            <div xml:id="m-12f6b38d-c522-4802-9ca1-f8c3635a483d">
              <lg xml:id="m-0d066b2d-64a4-4e5c-9797-76e3bf74eb6b">
                <l xml:id="m-635143df-955d-4aa6-ac48-093d7b925807" facs="#m-229f15ba-cfce-4e9b-a9ac-126b22aa8e33" label="ambiguous">407</l><l xml:id="m-f622d807-0af3-4e27-8dab-853b3bbe954c" facs="#m-da280958-4b3a-4069-a7a3-1c3ed953f9ba" label="text-like">At Terce.</l><l xml:id="m-e17a0722-b717-4ebc-a172-b6a9b2b56178" facs="#m-4d888e7f-9695-4b7d-bdd1-8fe8dcc2754b" label="text-like">Of Saint Anastasia.</l><l xml:id="m-181af506-7942-4a3e-aafa-07937c3978f5" facs="#m-70292eb5-eb18-4cb5-ad47-e11050ad0fc7" label="lyrics-like">(Atiásti, Dómine, familiam tuam! fove; cujus solémnia celebrámus.</l><l xml:id="m-9aaa7949-a442-416a-aeb1-8928a0f36901" facs="#m-fd851b31-ebeb-4bcc-bf00-4b04d2a8c8bc" label="lyrics-like">O munéribus sacris: ejus quaésu¬</l><l xml:id="m-6234eeb7-1563-462c-ab51-1a9be4be4095" facs="#m-beaf5e7f-9eb0-4833-974e-742173020a2a" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-f63bba4c-3fb7-40ec-9771-557fedd66359" facs="#m-a33dc679-2bb0-49b7-a981-f5dbaeba01db" label="lyrics-like">mus semper interventióne nos ré¬</l><l xml:id="m-31aee2b5-48bf-4b69-b06d-767300e6a444" facs="#m-37740cf2-479f-41cc-82a8-906d29c0ad8d" label="text-like">Terce is celebrated at the ordinary hour; then follows the Mass of</l><l xml:id="m-bbc3cd5d-0692-4ffc-8cfd-acb08e1f8eb5" facs="#m-b7d5c4fd-1862-4031-ac71-ba3aec822002" label="text-like">the Day.</l><l xml:id="m-9f51aa90-2787-486c-99ae-c209cd9d8ca4" facs="#m-77ba04bc-e6aa-489a-8fbe-49980584e552" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-02d95fd3-6d5d-4862-b4f7-a8248e27e269" facs="#m-d17589ca-bd02-4a30-9368-c0407b3a35e1" label="ambiguous">Hymn.8</l><l xml:id="m-a3a04338-50e7-4250-84d0-3733d1b26a3f" facs="#m-0c422072-fee7-48a3-8a38-ad0f644a07e2" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-682665ee-a8c6-4d9c-8024-f9f2868f3274" facs="#m-981557bf-218c-4693-8351-1d8fed253146" label="lyrics-like">Unc Sáncte nóbis Spí-ri-tus, U-num Pátri cum</l><l xml:id="m-20321b0b-aa59-4116-ac6c-3d3a47957804" facs="#m-94062ba5-6dba-412c-9656-c22898df150c" label="lyrics-like">Fi-li-o, Dignáre prómptus inge-ri</l><l xml:id="m-45edb32c-b93b-4622-bca8-af2ff2512098" facs="#m-12af1fc6-d1d0-41ef-8cc0-b8b2d68e815a" label="lyrics-like">Nóstro re-fú¬ sus</l><l xml:id="m-0ab73e42-029b-41b0-aa5a-928d5ded1e9d" facs="#m-115e9551-4aee-4476-b446-3f31227fc2f7" label="lyrics-like">péctori.</l><l xml:id="m-1e8191c5-b066-4b86-bbd9-3822acbe0391" facs="#m-8e0c6433-c380-424d-8d5a-127d8e5d946b" label="lyrics-like">Os, lingua, mens, sénsus, vígor, Praésta, Páter piissime,</l><l xml:id="m-1221ed1f-381a-4902-b950-6560a05fc682" facs="#m-d471f0d3-6293-4210-8deb-e207b2e07fe3" label="lyrics-like">Patrique cómpar Unice,</l><l xml:id="m-47a862d3-63b4-423b-a967-c12eea8ed848" facs="#m-c0d739e3-0f65-4328-9388-0660b2533e7b" label="lyrics-like">Confessiónem pérsonent:</l><l xml:id="m-cd59f0a6-b490-403b-981d-10309488995d" facs="#m-01d460ab-fab8-4903-a2f8-3495de728d3c" label="lyrics-like">cum Spiritu Paráclito,</l><l xml:id="m-0bde42fe-b384-4421-ada0-5f8ab072f028" facs="#m-ebc30101-b264-4f54-8d63-11c0316e0c2b" label="lyrics-like">Flamméscat igne cáritas,</l><l xml:id="m-f86f10ce-10ed-4039-a7f0-fd06929ff335" facs="#m-ee17c116-f10c-4666-9d59-e2f817fb9651" label="lyrics-like">Accéndat árdor próximos.</l><l xml:id="m-1ba9bd55-9e3f-49f8-b51b-2ba2448bd13f" facs="#m-1a7454c0-b8f8-4b96-83f6-8a08341aa450" label="lyrics-like">Régnans per ómne saéculum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-3e9b49f7-8258-4ae2-8a75-f6cf20763911" facs="#m-f40745db-0aee-439d-bf5a-dac4abf0c8f2" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Génuit puérpera Régem. p. 396.</l><l xml:id="m-1338d4a7-29ef-4fe1-b29f-04357c5ebdbd" facs="#m-45498c33-8af4-4a95-b446-7d6fcfa22abc" label="lyrics-like">Chapter. Multifáriam. as at Lauds, p. 400.</l><l xml:id="m-cde76d2a-5de0-4ff6-9a83-d73e11869b27" facs="#m-b9448419-1285-4d69-a6e1-3e9d1132bf75" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-8bc6e365-d283-416f-9069-bb2652afd9d1" facs="#m-bb0a894f-e395-4f46-90e3-90acbfd1f179" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-86aeeea6-9cb7-4b6d-9c5c-4f3cdef6848c" facs="#m-a618cad4-f80d-4c63-a17a-813f9e56a316" label="lyrics-like">Erbum cáro fáctum est :“Alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia. Vér¬</l><l xml:id="m-923fe991-85e6-47da-80e8-967cd3b3057f" facs="#m-7902417d-df25-4b5d-bdbb-c03c9b5eb1d3" label="lyrics-like">bum. V. Et habi-távit in nóbis. "Alle-lú-ia, alle lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-6810c82c-a3c0-4f77-8480-00f17e2e23c0" facs="#m-82ade05b-6a8f-49db-a294-06675fa72c3d" label="lyrics-like">V. Gló-ri-a Pátri, et Fí-li-o, et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-2127c097-7e5b-4766-b061-974155bf3cdd" facs="#m-eeb2669a-bdbb-4df7-9e43-ec9bfa2213c6" label="lyrics-like">Vérbum.</l><l xml:id="m-09380ace-0d61-4578-8962-6bfb4773d62e" facs="#m-1125d3e7-5bbe-4556-8042-12c84dbedf3c" label="lyrics-like">V. Ipse invocábit me, allelúia. R. Páter méus es tu, allelúia.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>